@endpoint http://localhost:5215

### GET alle Personen
GET {{endpoint}}/api/persons

### GET einzelne Person
GET {{endpoint}}/api/persons/1

### POST Person anlegen
POST {{endpoint}}/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "age": 30
}

### PUT Person aktualisieren
PUT {{endpoint}}/api/persons/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Updated",
  "age": 31
}

### DELETE Person löschen
DELETE {{endpoint}}/api/persons/1

### GET alle Haustiere
GET {{endpoint}}/api/pets

### POST Haustier anlegen
POST {{endpoint}}/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rex",
  "species": "Hund"
}

### PUT Haustier aktualisieren
PUT {{endpoint}}/api/pets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rex",
  "species": "Hund",
  "personId": 1
}

### DELETE Haustier löschen
DELETE {{endpoint}}/api/pets/1
